{"3390770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Royal Goldenbeak and the Curse of Snowy Island", "steam_appid": 3390770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4866070], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cinematic combat odyssey that is purely hand-drawn. ⚔️ Play the FREE demo this June—Wishlist now to get notified!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/01a01d256ba5f2e13c42e07d7f42f560.avif?t=1785989782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras_big/01a01d256ba5f2e13c42e07d7f42f560.avif?t=1785989782 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Follow the path. Recover the past. Save your friends. Fight for justice.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a snowy island with no memory. Who are you? Why are you here? To find the truth and reclaim your identity, you must embark on an epic journey through a treacherous and mysterious landscape. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9b87a0385a4d32bd4861440dd3897649.poster.avif?t=1785989782\" width=600 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9b87a0385a4d32bd4861440dd3897649.webm?t=1785989782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9b87a0385a4d32bd4861440dd3897649.mp4?t=1785989782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take brings you closer to unraveling the truth, protecting the companions you meet along the way, and standing up for what is right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9d5d05120cf3840c3fdbe8581c29d3ce.avif?t=1785989782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras_big/9d5d05120cf3840c3fdbe8581c29d3ce.webp?t=1785989782 width=1560 height=988 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/0d0bc581c9f73df37563cec0ad25bf05.avif?t=1785989782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras_big/0d0bc581c9f73df37563cec0ad25bf05.webp?t=1785989782 width=1560 height=901 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking Hand-Drawn Visuals:</strong> Every frame is a work of art. Immerse yourself in a unique comic-book style where every environment, from glowing caves to frost-covered peaks, is meticulously illustrated by hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Dynamic Soundtrack:</strong> Experience a &quot;superb&quot; auditory journey. Our unique score blends classical elegance with modern electronic pulses, perfectly syncing with your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Exploration:</strong> Run, climb, and jump through diverse landscapes. Carve your path through fighting against relentless evil robots as you uncover the secrets of the Snowy Island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kindness is Your Compass:</strong> You aren't just fighting; you're a beacon of hope. Encounter penguins and quirky friends in need. Rescue them and guide them to safety to see the true heart of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cinematic Comic Experience:</strong> This single-player journey blends an emotional quest with satisfying gameplay. The focus remains on the drive to see what happens next in the unfolding story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to explore a hand-crafted world, bring warmth back to the island and help Royal uncover the truth?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cinematic combat odyssey that is purely hand-drawn. ⚔️ Play the FREE demo this June—Wishlist now to get notified!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/01a01d256ba5f2e13c42e07d7f42f560.avif?t=1785989782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras_big/01a01d256ba5f2e13c42e07d7f42f560.avif?t=1785989782 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Follow the path. Recover the past. Save your friends. Fight for justice.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a snowy island with no memory. Who are you? Why are you here? To find the truth and reclaim your identity, you must embark on an epic journey through a treacherous and mysterious landscape. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9b87a0385a4d32bd4861440dd3897649.poster.avif?t=1785989782\" width=600 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9b87a0385a4d32bd4861440dd3897649.webm?t=1785989782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9b87a0385a4d32bd4861440dd3897649.mp4?t=1785989782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step you take brings you closer to unraveling the truth, protecting the companions you meet along the way, and standing up for what is right. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/9d5d05120cf3840c3fdbe8581c29d3ce.avif?t=1785989782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras_big/9d5d05120cf3840c3fdbe8581c29d3ce.webp?t=1785989782 width=1560 height=988 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras/0d0bc581c9f73df37563cec0ad25bf05.avif?t=1785989782\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/extras_big/0d0bc581c9f73df37563cec0ad25bf05.webp?t=1785989782 width=1560 height=901 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking Hand-Drawn Visuals:</strong> Every frame is a work of art. Immerse yourself in a unique comic-book style where every environment, from glowing caves to frost-covered peaks, is meticulously illustrated by hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Dynamic Soundtrack:</strong> Experience a &quot;superb&quot; auditory journey. Our unique score blends classical elegance with modern electronic pulses, perfectly syncing with your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Exploration:</strong> Run, climb, and jump through diverse landscapes. Carve your path through fighting against relentless evil robots as you uncover the secrets of the Snowy Island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kindness is Your Compass:</strong> You aren't just fighting; you're a beacon of hope. Encounter penguins and quirky friends in need. Rescue them and guide them to safety to see the true heart of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cinematic Comic Experience:</strong> This single-player journey blends an emotional quest with satisfying gameplay. The focus remains on the drive to see what happens next in the unfolding story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to explore a hand-crafted world, bring warmth back to the island and help Royal uncover the truth?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Battle to save the Snowy Island in this cinematic arcade-adventure. Rescue quirky companions, defeat relentless evil robots, and restore warmth to a breathtaking, hand-drawn world. Wishlist now to be the first to play the upcoming demo in June!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/header.jpg?t=1785989782", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/b996c75da3a17ceb837ca8cbeebfd0a342c88ec7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785989782", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390770/b996c75da3a17ceb837ca8cbeebfd0a342c88ec7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785989782", "website": "https://outsidethezoo.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM, AMD Radeon RX Vega 8 / Intel HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_